I just found a simple, foolproof way of robbing shops in 3.1 ...

There is a spoiler here. Read it? [ynq]

You feel spoiled.

You will need:
A large dog, or equally hefty pet
Any uncursed container (sack, chest, whatever)

Sell the container to the shopkeeper. Make sure it's marked
"(unpaid)". (Or just use one that's already in the shop.) Put all the
stuff you want from the shop in the container.  Drop the
container. Let your dog steal it.

This way you get all the stuff you want -- including the cursed stuff
your dog normally won't touch -- in one fell swoop. Your pet needs to
be strong enough to pick up the container. He doesn't really need to
be trained, however: as soon as he picks it up (which shouldn't take
long if its the only thing in the shop) just herd him out the shop or,
better yet, blow that magic whistle!

One hassle: you can't specify "u" as a type of object to put in the
container!

